// One packed 0xRRGGBB color per grid corner: shade by height (../color/
// tiers.id + idstd d2_pack), then darken by distance for a cheap fog feel
// (../color/fog.id). gz (the row, 0..39) is recovered from the flat index the
// same way coords.id's corner_z does.

corner_color(int grid_index) {
  int terrain_height = (import heights)[grid_index];
  int gz = grid_index / 13;
  int shaded_color = shaded_fog(terrain_height, gz);
} return int shaded_color;
